<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea firms buy 30,000T Brazilian soymeal.</title>
<headline>South Korea firms buy 30,000T Brazilian soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyer group, known as the Big Feed Mills, bought 30,000 tonnes of Brazilian soymeal at $319.50 a tonne C&amp;F, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>They said the buyer group bought the soymeal from Louis Dreyfus for arrival by September 20 to the two South Korean ports of Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for July 20-August 10 if from South America.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
